  "selfReview": "Deadpan: the motif head (D D A) on pizzicato and piano, a beat and a half of nothing, then Badger's Eb-D. Critic round 1 (2026-11-24): his two notes are on the finger-plucked bass, pizzicato celli and basses, an octave-up celli double and his own cross-stick: he sits 1.7 dB over the motif head on full range and level with it on the phone model (1.1 and 2.6 dB under before). The rest's comic timing needs an ear. There is room after 2.6 s for the owner's real dog sound.",
